  "prefLabel": "En 306.07 Department Inspection",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 306.07 Department Inspection. The department shall inspect the works and system of each utility as necessary to ensure the manner in which each utility has conformed and presently conforms to department rules including, without limitation, with respect to safety policies and procedures, and employee compliance therewith.\n\nSource. #14101, eff 10-22-24, EXPIRES: 10-22-34 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for En 300)",
